# Verboten Spirits

> An independent South African brandy house in Silverton, Pretoria. Founded in
> 2020 by two founders. Premium brandy and a ready to drink brandy and cola,
> sold online across South Africa and poured at bars, restaurants and events.
> Tagline: Pure Spirit. Pure Mischief.

Verboten is German for forbidden. The name is a promise about restraint:
nothing leaves the house unless it earns the label. The house position is that
the best traditions often start with someone breaking the rules.

## Products

- [Verboten Premium Brandy](https://verboten.co.za/shop/verboten-premium-brandy): R450. 750ml, 43% ABV, aged 3 years, finished in french oak casks. A three year South African brandy, finished in French oak and bottled at 43% ABV. Born in Pretoria, made for the world.
- [Verboten Brandy & Cola](https://verboten.co.za/shop/verboten-brandy-cola): R45. 440ml, 5% ABV. The same spirit with its collar loosened. 440ml at 5%, pre-mixed and ready. Cold, easy, and unmistakably South African.
- [Verboten Premium Set, 2 Bottles](https://verboten.co.za/shop/verboten-premium-set-2-bottle): R850. Two bottles of Verboten Premium Brandy for R850, fifty rand under buying them one at a time.
- [Verboten NYX](https://verboten.co.za/shop/verboten-nyx): R250. 750ml, 43% ABV. Liquorice and anise in the Greek style, bottled at 43%. Very cold and neat, or long with cola.
- [Verboten Blood Orange Gin](https://verboten.co.za/shop/verboten-blood-orange-gin): R250. 750ml. Blood orange gin, 750ml. Bright at the front, bitter at the edge, dry where it counts.

Delivery is R150 flat anywhere in South Africa, free from R2 500. Ships within 1 to 2 weeks

